was the owner of Jurassic Park.

00:02:51.437 --> 00:02:52.538
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.538 --> 00:02:54.106
That's not even --

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:56.208
It's a movie.
-Oh, my God. Richard --

00:02:56.208 --> 00:02:58.511
-It thought
Senator Roger Marshall

00:02:58.511 --> 00:03:00.446
